    <!-- About: wording about what the product is and is not comes from docs/CLAIMS.md and is not to be paraphrased -->
    <string name="about_title">About CargoClear</string>
    <string name="about_version">Version %1$s</string>
    <string name="about_what_title">What this app is</string>
    <string name="about_what_body">Pre-submission customs document assessment. Decision support only: the authorised CHA decides. Nothing is submitted to a government system, nothing is a legal determination, and no duty is collected or paid.</string>
    <string name="about_rules_title">Rules and rates</string>
    <string name="about_rules_body">The rule tables (alloy thresholds, standards\' limits, duty rates, exchange rates, the anti-dumping entry, declaration inputs) are demo-curated, unverified, and partly placeholders. The model only reads documents: every status, check and estimate comes from the service\'s deterministic rules, and this app shows what the service returns.</string>
    <string name="about_reading_title">Reading documents</string>
    <string name="about_reading_body">In demo mode the extraction is synthetic and keyed by file name; it does not read the documents. When a model reads them, the percentage shown is the lowest confidence it reported for the values the checks rest on: a self-reported score, not a measured accuracy.</string>
    <string name="about_access_title">Access</string>
    <string name="about_access_body">There is no sign-in. Anyone who has a bundle\'s id or link can open it and see its documents. This app keeps the ids of the bundles you open on this phone only and puts nothing in a cloud backup. Its own code writes no logs.</string>
    <string name="about_audit_title">The audit chain</string>
    <string name="about_audit_body">The audit chain is tamper-evident: editing an event breaks it. Where a signature exists it is checked against the operator\'s key (a demo key proves less than a Cloud KMS key, and says so). It is not legal non-repudiation: there is no user authentication, so the signer is the service, not a person.</string>
    <string name="about_phone_title">On this phone</string>
    <string name="about_phone_body">Bundles you open are listed on the start screen so you can get back to them (the service keeps no list). Documents you view and pre-fill packs you share are kept in a private cache that Settings can clear. Nothing of this app is included in a cloud backup or a device transfer. Notifications and the scanner are off unless you use them.</string>
    <string name="about_scanner_title">The optional scanner</string>
    <string name="about_scanner_body">Scanning a paper document is provided by Google Play services and ML Kit, which are governed by Google\'s own terms. It is offered only where they are present.</string>
    <string name="about_licences_title">Open-source components</string>
    <string name="settings_about">About CargoClear</string>
    <string name="settings_about_hint">What this app is and is not, how it treats your data, and its open-source components</string>

    <string name="dev_backend_line">Backend: %1$s</string>
